              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Kit meno abuto aryeba cwiny i nyim Rwot nino pyeraŋwen dyeceŋ ki dyewor, pien onoŋo Rwot owaco ni emito tyekowu woko. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.9.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.9.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 9:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ci yam alego bot Rwot ni, ‘Ai Rwot Lubaŋa, pe ityek lwakki woko, ma gin aye gipinnyi ma yam ikokogi pi ditti, ma ikwanyogi woko ki i Ejipt pi twero me badi, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.9.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.9.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 9:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ber ipo i kom luticci Abraim, Icaka ki Yakobo. Pe ibed ka paro pi tek ŋut pa rok man, nyo pi timgi maraco, nyo pi balgi, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.9.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.9.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 9:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "wek jo me lobo ma yam ikwanyowa ki iye-ni pe gubed ka waco ni,. Pien onoŋo terogi i lobo ma yam ocikke pire botgi doŋ oloyo Rwot woko, dok pien onoŋo yam kara dag wangi, en aye omiyo okwanyogi woko, wek enekgi woko i dye tim, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.9.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.9.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 9:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Pien gin aye lwakki, gin gipinnyi, ma doŋ ikelogi woko ki tekki madwoŋ ki pi ciŋi ma iryeyo.’",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.9.29",
